stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT
    DRAFT --> APPROVED: current owner approval
    APPROVED --> RUNNING: begin approved campaign
    RUNNING --> PAUSED: admission paused
    PAUSED --> RUNNING: revalidate approval and budget
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: objective or normal stop
    RUNNING --> FAILED: terminal fault
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: settle active attempts
    PAUSED --> CANCELLED: stop and reconcile
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
